SUMMARY:D&D Adventurers League: DDEX1-07 Drums in the Marsh
DESCRIPTION:DDEX1-07 Drums in the Marsh\n\nFor the past several nights\, d
 rums have been heard on the wind\, coming from the Twilight Marsh. Each 
 morning\, more turn up missing from the nearby farms\, leaving only mudd
 y\, clawed footprints heading towards the marsh. Can you help find the l
 ost and bring justice to the abductors?\n\nThis is a Tier 1 adventure fo
 r character levels 1-4.\n\nNOTE: Our game venue is 21 and over only.\n\n
 Sign up for the session on our Discord server. Grab the invite link at h
 ttps://saltydragons.com/.
LOCATION:Bacchus & Venus\, 769 Bridgeway\, Sausalito\, CA
